<http://data.silknow.org/object/1c1174fe-8e05-3280-8cfa-b84a03ad15c9>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Grayish-tan figured silk ground. Brocaded in silver wire and gilded silver wire wound on silk cores, tinsel and gilded tinsel, gilded silver frisé yarn and polychrome silks. Intertwined ribbons with scalloped edges and floral sprays tied with ribbons and tassels. Selvedge on one side and on part of the other of six cords and a wide stripe. Many splits and holes, soiled."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ef30ddb1-cee2-3aec-af59-23b2cebabc49> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Grayish-tan figured silk ground. Brocaded in silver wire and gilded silver wire wound on silk cores, tinsel and gilded tinsel, gilded silver frisé yarn and polychrome silks. Intertwined ribbons with scalloped edges and floral sprays tied with ribbons and tassels. Selvedge on one side and on part of the other of six cords and a wide stripe. Many splits and holes, soiled."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/1c1174fe-8e05-3280-8cfa-b84a03ad15c9/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/1c1174fe-8e05-3280-8cfa-b84a03ad15c9/dimension/1> ;
